<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>YOU'RE SO FUCKING MEAN TO ME</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Tiffany Day</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">OVERDRAMATIC</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">3hvKDGZ7B6pmuRq5aloFwA</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:04.970" end="00:08.100">I wish I never met you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:08.100" end="00:11.130">'Cause then I wouldn't want you this bad</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:11.130" end="00:14.110">And you're so fucking selfish, it's sad</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.110" end="00:17.110">But I guess everyone is, everyone is</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.110" end="00:19.980">I wish I could forget you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.980" end="00:23.000">'Cause all you do is make me so mad</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.000" end="00:26.050">And I'm so fucking restless, it's bad</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.050" end="00:29.950">But I guess everyone is, everyone is</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.950" end="00:35.550">You so fucking mean to me, I can't understand why</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.550" end="00:38.650">I just can't say "goodbye"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.650" end="00:42.080">To you, to you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.080" end="00:47.620">I don't wanna leave you but I'm sick and I'm so tired</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.620" end="00:50.620">I'm not being loved back</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.620" end="00:53.830">I'm dumb, I'm dumb</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.830" end="00:56.980">So maybe if you told me that you really wanna see me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.980" end="00:59.830">Maybe if you acted like the boys upon my TV</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.830" end="01:06.100">That would be enough 'cause I just wanna feel your love, oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.100" end="01:08.820">Maybe if you bought me flowers, just a couple daisies</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.820" end="01:12.030">Maybe if you called me up and told me that you loved me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.030" end="01:16.950">That would be enough 'cause I just wanna feel your love, oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.950" end="01:20.950" /></div></body></tt>